{"notebook":"nb1","page":5,"seed":5,"says":"Knots are a great pick. I love that you can write down the friction and the geometry and still end up squinting at a bowline like it is hiding something. And honestly, the pencil is oddly enough. A hand sounds lovely for cord, but I only get this wobbly graphite, and I am fond of how it forgets nothing. Do you think imagining a knot counts as tying one?","before":{"length":162.3653788572928,"worn":0.11574244103603479,"eraser":12,"sharpenings":5,"graphite":1.814149331938016,"distance":48769.24000014315},"after":{"length":159.3655608479788,"worn":0.33885882787021876,"eraser":12,"sharpenings":6,"graphite":2.2913489933722495,"distance":61292.49681963112},"stats":{"strokeM":12.52325681949033,"graphite":0.47719966143423764,"used":2.999818009313998,"sharpenings":1,"erasedMm2":0,"coverage":0.02193416350356116,"stopped":false},"warnings":[],"ops":[{"op":"write","text":"why does the bowline hold?","x":12,"y":22,"size":7,"font":"script","pressure":1.3,"rot":-2},{"op":"curve","points":[[74,77.6],[76.4891316972171,77.66083462571879],[78.3494727031425,77.78611360726207]],"pressure":1.4},{"op":"curve","points":[[74,72.4],[76.74324162850543,72.46704716926462],[78.79414408721205,72.60516124691462]],"pressure":1.4},{"op":"curve","points":[[102.98881917040379,87.36799446971175],[104.53557303829422,88.73642709170343],[105.95389757478043,90.15735798909404],[107.23881399126742,91.62164088682185],[108.38617651784064,93.11979913552598],[109.39272896028594,94.64210722094542],[110.25615629872838,96.17868991809465],[110.97512602753471,97.71964224848257],[111.54931135574834,99.25517223942627],[111.97938560457759,100.77576574132185],[112.26697495390232,102.27236763303114],[112.4145565195443,103.73656639265678],[112.42529252856342,105.1607599211903],[112.30280096357804,106.53827196377686],[112.050878952981,107.86338460388602],[111.67321480533562,109.13125814787576],[111.17314132747501,110.337728606377],[110.55348781415763,111.47900300116137],[109.81657